---
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { site, uploadRules } from '../config/site';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = 'November 2, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${site.name} collects, uses and protects your information.`}
>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy policy" lead={`Last updated ${updated}.`} />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow prose">
      <p>
        {site.name} is an independent, student-run business. This policy explains what we collect
        when you use this website and what we do with it. We are not affiliated with Gordon College,
        and we don’t share your information with the college.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Bookings:</strong> your name, email, phone number, residence hall, room number,
          chosen package and time, payment preference (cash or Venmo) and any notes you add.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Quote requests:</strong> your contact details, a description of the job and any
          photos you upload.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Job applications:</strong> your contact details, class year, availability and your
          answers.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Messages:</strong> whatever you send through the contact form.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Security data:</strong> to stop spam and abuse we use Cloudflare Turnstile, and we
          keep short-lived counters keyed by a one-way hash of your IP address. We never store your
          raw IP address.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>We don’t take payment details online, and we don’t use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        Only to schedule and carry out cleanings, answer your requests, review job applications, and
        keep the site secure. We don’t sell your information or use it for marketing.
      </p>

      <h2>Who can see it</h2>
      <p>
        Only the {site.name} owner and staff who need it to do the job. Your cleaner sees your name,
        hall, room and booking details. Our website runs on Cloudflare, and we use an email provider
        to send booking notifications. These providers process data on our behalf.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Quote photos are deleted automatically after {uploadRules.retentionDays} days.</li>
        <li>Messages, quote requests and unsuccessful applications are kept for up to 1 year.</li>
        <li>Booking records are kept for up to 2 years for bookkeeping.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us to show you, correct or delete your information at any time by emailing{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>. We’ll respond within 30
        days.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If we change this policy, we’ll update the date at the top of this page.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }
  .prose li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
